    skos:altLabel 'RCM 7/8'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Aanderaa RCM 7/8 Recording Current Meter'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Family of self-recording paddle wheel current meters with different pressure cases that record the vector averaged speed and direction over a sampling interval. The paddle wheel rotor is magnetically coupled to an electronic counter. The meter has a balanced weight vane which aligns it with the current flow. For more details see http://www.bodc.ac.uk/data/documents/nodb/65611/.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0121'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0273/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0273/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0273/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'RD200A echosounder'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'RD200A echosounder'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A single-beam navigational echo sounder optimised for measurements of water depth below keel in water depths less than 100m.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0273'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0200/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0200/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0200/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'Ruthern pH monitor'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Ruthern Instruments marine pH monitor'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A pH monitor that may be included in either a portable or bulkhead-mounted system. It consists of a highly reproducible free-diffusion liquid junction which reduces the usual liquid junction potential error encountered with electrode systems. A capillary liquid junction is formed between the reference reservior (containing the silver/silver chloride electrode) and the pH cell (containing the pH electrode and the sample to be analysed). Capable of extreme accuracy and long term stability, giving a precision of +/- 0.01 pH unit across the salinity range 1 to 40 ppt combined with temperature precision to 0.02 deg C.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0200'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0154/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0154/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0154/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'S4 CM'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Interocean S4 current meter'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Basic elecromagnetic current meter with two pairs of internal electrodes and a flux-gate compass with integral data logger'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0154'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0156/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0156/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0156/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'S4A CM'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Interocean S4A current meter'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Advanced elecromagnetic current meter with two pairs of internal electrodes and a flux-gate compass with high capacity integral data logger. Includes adaptive current sampling as standard.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0156'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0153/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0153/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0153/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'S4AD CM'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Interocean S4AD current meter'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A current meter is designed to directly measure the true magnitude and direction current motion in any water environment using two pairs of titanium electrodes located symmetrically on the equator of the sensor. An internal flux-gate compass provides heading information, used to reference current direction to magnetic North or, for fixed installations, the instrument may be operated in an X-Y orthogonal mode whereby the current vector can be referenced to a landform or structure. It can be deployed upto depths of 6000m. Further information may be found on the BODC document server at URL http://www.bodc.ac.uk/data/documents/nodb/40555/. The "A" designation indicates advanced current measurement with adaptive sampling as standard. The "D" indicates a pressure-hardened casing.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0153'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0157/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0157/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0157/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'S4DW CM/wave'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Interocean S4DW current meter directional wave monitor'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Instrument combines electromagnetic current sensors and a high precision pressure sensor to measure wave orbital current components,directional wave spectra and tides. Incorporates programmable burst mode sampling and a very high capacity data logger.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0157'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0155/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0155/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0155/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'S4R CM'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Interocean S4R current meter'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Basic elecromagnetic current meter with two pairs of internal electrodes and a flux-gate compass with no integral data logger. Designed for real-time monitoring applications.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0155'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0180/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0180/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0180/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'SAIV SD-204 CTD'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'SAIV SD-204 CTD'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A CTD that measures, calculates and records sea water conductivity, salinity, temperature, depth (pressure),  sound velocity and water density. Three optional sensors can be added, for example: dissolved oxygen, fluorescence and turbidity. For optional sensors with several sensitivies, the SD204 has an autorange capability. The instrument is equipped with a mooring bar with a shackle at each end. Data are recorded in physical units and simultaneously transmitted via an RS232 I/O watertight connector for on-line use.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0180'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0266/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0266/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0266/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'SBE 39 TR'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Sea-Bird SBE 39 temperature recorder'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A high-accuracy temperature recorder (pressure optional) with internal battery and non-volatile memory for deployment at depths up to 10500 meters. It is intended for moorings or other long-term, fixed-site applications, as well as shorter-term deployments on nets, towed vehicles or ROVs. Calibration coefficients stored in EEPROM allow the SBE 39 to transmit data in engineering units. The SBE 39 thermistor has a long history of exceptional accuracy and stability (typical drift is less than 0.002C per year). The SBE 39 communicates directly with a computer via a standard RA-232 interface. For more information see http://www.bodc.ac.uk/data/documents/nodb/108627/'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0266'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0189/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0189/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0189/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'SCUFA II fluorometer'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Turner Designs SCUFA II Submersible Fluorometer'@en ;
    skos:definition 'An accurate, versatile submersible fluorometer for chlorophyll and dye tracking applications. It is capable of operation in a wide range of concentrations and environmental conditions. Output options include chlorophyll-a, cyanobacteria, Rhodamine WT, fluorescin. A turbidity sensor may also be incorporated and logged as a parallel channel. From 1 December 2008, Turner Designs have discontinued all SCUFA Submersible Fluorometer applications. Supported until end 2013'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0189'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0246/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0246/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0246/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'SP500 spectrophotometer'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Unicam SP500 spectrophotometer'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A laboratory instrument that measures the amount of light at discrete pre-determined wavelengths that is transmitted or emitted by a sample.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0246'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0187/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0187/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0187/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'SeaTech S131 fluorometer'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'SeaTech S131 fluorometer'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A chlorophyll-a fluorometer with six internally selectable ranges, permitting measurement of chlorophyll-a permitting measurement of chlorophyll-a concentrations from approximately 0.015ug/l to 1000ug/l.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0187'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0119/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0119/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0119/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'Seapoint SCF'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Seapoint chlorophyll fluorometer'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A high-performance, low power fluorometer for in-situ measurements of chlorophyll-a able to operate at depths of up to 6000 metres. May be used open in-situ or with a pump through sample volume. Internal circuitry gives an output voltage that is proportional to chlorophyll-a concentration.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0119'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0104/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0104/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0104/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'Seapoint Turbidity Meter'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Seapoint Turbidity Meter'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A turbidity meter that detects light scattered by particles suspended in water and generates an output voltage proportional to the SPM concentration. Range is selected by two digital lines which can be hard wired or microprocessor controlled, thereby choosing the appropriate range and resolution for measurement of extremely clean to very turbid waters. The offset voltage is within 1 mV of zero and requires no adjustment across gains. The optical design confines the sensing volume to within 5 cm of the sensor allowing near-bottom measurements and minimizing errant reflections in restricted spaces. Further information may be found on the BODC document server at URL: http://www.bodc.ac.uk/data/documents/nodb/119173/'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0104'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0239/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0239/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0239/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'SiS RTM 4002 X'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'SiS RTM 4002 X digital reversing thermometer'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A second-generation digital thermometer that collects a burst of temperature readings when inverted. It has a range of -2C to 40C, a resolution of 0.0001C below 10C (0.001C above 10C) and an accuracy of 0.003C. A glass-titanium housing with double o-ring seals of similar physical dimensions to an Hg-in-glass instrument gives an operating depth of 10000m.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0239'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0198/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0198/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0198/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'Simrad EK-60 echosounder'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Simrad EK-60 echosounder'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A split-beam scientific echosounder primarily designed for fisheries research. It can operate seven frequencies simultaneously ranging from 18 to 710 kHz. Real time echo integration and target strength analysis in an unlimited number of layers is provided as well as storage of raw data for replay or analysis in one of several post-processing software packages such as Simrad\'s BI60.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0198'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0262/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0262/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0262/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'Sippican T-5 XBT'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Lockheed Martin Sippican T-5 XBT probe'@en ;
    skos:definition 'An expendable free-fall temperature probe that provides a profile of measured temperature against depth calculated from a fall-rate model. The T-5 XBT Probe can be used within a maximum depth of 1830m, may be deployed at a ship speed of up to 6 knots and has a vertical resolution of 65cm.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0262'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0263/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0263/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0263/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'Sippican T-7 XBT'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Lockheed Martin Sippican T-7 XBT probe'@en ;
    skos:definition 'An expendable free-fall temperature probe that provides a profile of measured temperature against depth calculated from a fall-rate model. The T-7 XBT Probe can be used within a maximum depth of 760m, may be deployed at a ship speed of up to 15 knots and has a vertical resolution of 65cm.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0263'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0183/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0183/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0183/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'Star-Oddi DST CTD'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Star-Oddi DST CTD'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A miniature self-contained CTD primarily designed for mounting on fish, birds or marine mammals. Salinity resolution is 0.02 PSU and accuracy +-0.75 PSU. Temperature resolution is 0.032C and accuracy +-0.1C.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0183'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0139/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0139/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0139/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'Sunburst SAMI-CO2'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Sunburst Submersible Autonomous Moored Instrument Carbon Dioxide Sensor'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A reagent based CO2 sensor for measuring partial pressure of carbon dioxide (pCO2) in-situ in water over a range of approximately 0-2000 micro-atmospheres with a precision of approximately 1 microatmosphere at 360 microatmospheres. Maximum deployment depth is approximately 100 metres for SAMI-CO2-100 (PVC housing) and 1500 metres for SAMI-CO2-1500 (aluminium housing).'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0139'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0221/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0221/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0221/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'TE525 rain gauge'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Texas Electronics TE525 rain gauge'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A tipping bucket rain gauge with a 6 inch collector and levelling screw adjustment. The sensor output has a switch closure for each bucket tip. It has a resolution of 0.01 inches and accuracy of between 1 and 5% depending on rainfall rate (more accurate for lighter rainfall). Marketed by Campbell Scientific.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0221'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0276/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0276/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0276/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'TSG103 thermosalinograph'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'OceanData TSG103 thermosalinograph'@en ;
    skos:definition 'An autoranging instrument taking inputs from a hull or inlet thermometer to give sea temperature plus co-located temperature and conductivity sensors to give salinity. In general use during the 1980s and 1990s'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0276'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0237/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0237/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0237/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'Thermometer'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Waterproof thermometer'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A generic term for a temperature sensor capable of being immersed in water primarily intended to measure water body temperature but could also be used to determine temperature of other matrices.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0237'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0231/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0231/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0231/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'Tinytag TGP-0050 TR'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Gemini Tinytag plus TGP-0050 temperature recorder'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A data logger plus a 10k NTC thermistor internally mounted within a robust IP68 waterproof casing suitable for measuring atmospheric or shallow water temperatures. Temperatures in the range -30 to 50C can be measured and the logger may be used up to water depths of 15 metres. The instrument can store approximately 16000 data readings and be set up with measurement intervals between one second and ten days.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0231'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0182/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0182/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0182/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'Tinytalk TK-0040 TR'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Omni Tinytalk TK-0040 temperature recorder'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A miniature temperature logger with a user programmed time interval. This model has an encapsulated thermistor with a range of -30 to 50C at a resolution of 0.25C and an accuracy of +-0.2C. It is housed in a splashproof metal 35mm film cannister.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0182'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0199/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0199/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0199/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'Trimble NT300D GPS'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Trimble NT300D Global Positioning System receiver'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A high-performance, sub-meter position GPS receiver for marine applications. It combines a state-of-the-art, 12-channel GPS receiver and a high-performance dual-channel transmitter. It was discontinued in 2009.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0199'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0145/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0145/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0145/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'Unknown fluorometer'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Unknown chlorophyll fluorometer'@en ;
    skos:definition 'An in-situ instrument that transmits pulses of UV light into a region of the surrounding water body and records the amount of red light generated as a result by chlorophyll fluorescence.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0145'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0148/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0148/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0148/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'Unknown transmissometer'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Unknown transmissometer'@en ;
    skos:definition 'An in-situ instrument that transmits monochromatic light through a region of the surrounding water body and records how much is received by a sensor a fixed distance away.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0148'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0127/1/> .
<http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0127/1/>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dc:isVersionOf <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0127/>;
    dc:modified '2010-05-18T16:10:58'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'Vaisala WAV151 vane'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Vaisala WAV151 wind vane'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A counter-balanced, low-threshold, optoelectic wind-vane. Infrared LEDs and phototransistors are mounted on six orbits on each side of a 6-bit GRAY-coded disc. Turning the vane causes the disc to change the code received by the phototransistors.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L22::TOOL0127'^^xsd:string .
